          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "line1": "<span class=\"fontsize-2-5-vw\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Monoaxial locking plate system for treating proximal tibia fractures.</span></span>",
          "line2": "<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-2vw\"><br>\r\n </span></span><span class=\"fontsize-2vw\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255,181,0);\">Plating that fits.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-2vw\">Every minute counts in the OR. From a population-based implant design, a patented screw-to-plate interface, and streamlined instrumentation, our focus is on creating a well-designed plating system, giving you more time to focus on other things.</span></span></p>\r\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Dec 28 2022 01:18:09 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/largeheadline",
